There are a couple of things that I think would make explore mode better 
for the player who has the early to middle parts of the game worked out 
(or thinks they have) but still needs a few tries to work out the late game.

One would be a second-chance for explore mode after death. You die, you 
are recorded, then you get an option to resurrect and continue in 
explore mode so you can experiment and see how you might have escaped. 
That way, in your next real game, you might know a successful way to get 
through, instead of just one more failure.

For a similar reason I would like to have an "explore mode save" 
available. This would allow you to continue playing normally after 
saving, but with the catch that the saved game would be in explore mode. 
  This would allow you to take a shot at ascending normally, but with an 
option to come back and try other approaches in explore mode later.


